
# House commit style — uncomment and fill in:
# <issue> | <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# type:  feat | fix | refactor | docs | test | perf | chore | ci | build | revert
# scope: api | web | infra | data | ui | auth | ci
#
# Rules: imperative mood, lowercase, no trailing period, one logical change.
# Reference the issue, e.g. "#42 | feat(dashboard): add live AQI card"
